---
---

<section id="craftsmanship" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24">
  
  <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#14204A] via-[#0E1736] to-[#0A1024] p-3 sm:p-4 border border-[#CBAC70]/30 shadow-2xl">
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#070D1F] border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-12 space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Top Headline -->
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#CBAC70] uppercase tracking-widest font-mono">
            THE CRAFTSMANSHIP STANDARD
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#FDFCFF] leading-tight uppercase">
            300GSM Combed Cotton <br/>
            <span class="gold-gradient-pure">No Compromise on Fabric Quality.</span>
          </h2>
          <p className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
            Di Malega Apparel, kami menolak bahan tipis yang mudah susut dan melar. Setiap artikel diproduksi dari 100% benang katun combed berkualitas dengan gramasi 300GSM padat, rib kerah 3.5cm berkonstruksi ganda, serta siluet drop-shoulder kontemporer.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 self-center">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0B132B] border border-[#CBAC70]/30 text-center space-y-1">
            <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[#CBAC70]">300<span class="text-xs font-bold text-white">GSM</span></span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8] font-medium">Gramasi Tebal Padat</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0B132B] border border-emerald-500/30 text-center space-y-1">
            <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-emerald-400">100<span class="text-xs font-bold text-white">%</span></span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8] font-medium">Combed Cotton Murni</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0B132B] border border-cyan-500/30 text-center space-y-1">
            <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-400">3.5<span class="text-xs font-bold text-white">cm</span></span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8] font-medium">Double Rib Collar</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0B132B] border border-[#CBAC70]/30 text-center space-y-1">
            <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[#CBAC70]">4.9<span class="text-xs font-bold text-white">★</span></span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8] font-medium">Kepuasan Pembeli</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 Pillars Breakdown -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 text-xs">
        
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#0B132B] border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-[#CBAC70] font-black text-xs block">01. HEAVYWEIGHT FABRIC</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Solid & Tidak Terawang</h4>
          <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Gramasi 300GSM memberikan struktur jatuhan kain yang tegap dan kokoh saat dikenakan seharian.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#0B132B] border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-[#CBAC70] font-black text-xs block">02. DOUBLE RIB COLLAR</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Kerah Kokoh Anti-Melar</h4>
          <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Konstruksi rib ganda 3.5cm mempertahankan bentuk bulat kerah pasca puluhan siklus pencucian.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#0B132B] border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-[#CBAC70] font-black text-xs block">03. BOXY SILHOUETTE</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Drop-Shoulder Proporsional</h4>
          <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Potongan bahu turun dan badan boxy yang dirancang khusus untuk kenyamanan estetika streetwear modern.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#0B132B] border border-white/5 space-y-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-[#CBAC70] font-black text-xs block">04. REACTIVE ECO-DYE</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Pewarnaan Pekat Abadi</h4>
          <p class="text-[#94A3B8] text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Warna hitam onyx dan palet earth-tone yang menyatu ke serat kain tanpa mudah luntur atau kusam.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</section>
